OL,3,GNEWSATraders' anger at 'temporary'
OL,4,Amarket made permanent
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraders from Rotherham Indoor Market
OL,7,Fhave accused the town's council of
OL,8,Fbroken promises after being told that
OL,9,Fwhat was supposed to be their temporary
OL,10,Fhome would now be made permanent.
OL,12,FStallholders moved out of the Indoor
OL,13,FMarket on Howard Street in July on the
OL,14,Funderstanding they could return in 18
OL,15,Fmonths after its renovation, but the
OL,16,Fcouncil has since confirmed it could
OL,17,Fnot afford to make the required
OL,18,Fimprovements.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
