OL,3,GNEWSATraders' anger at 'temporary'
OL,4,Amarket made permanent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stallholders' current home at the
OL,7,FMarket Hall building on Drummond Street
OL,8,Fwould instead be improved, the council
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FBut traders have said the Market Hall
OL,12,Fwas not a suitable long-term space,
OL,13,Fwith trade down 50% on the previous
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
